    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40971" root="هد" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدْهَدَةٌ</span></b>  [an inf. n. used as a simple subst.] The
<i>murmuring</i> or <i>confused sound of</i> the <i>cooing</i> of
pigeons, and <i>of</i> the <i>braying</i> of a camel [and of
thunder (see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمْزَمَةٌ</span>)]: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدَاهِدُ</span>. (S, L.)

